version dukor_forecast
  cite story
  governs always
  known 2026-01-02
  assumed "F8: the story's forecast keeps DUKOR 6M at the fixing of 2025-12-31 for 2026 – 2028; a row of the base (not of the scenario forecast), since a scenario row of a base item governs only from the scenario's from, which would make the mortgage's days law-dated (LOAD-LAWDATE)"
  dukor_6m[2026-01-01..2028-12-31] = 4.28 %/year known 2026-01-02 "F8: DUKOR 6M stays at the fixing of 2025-12-31"
